    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "c. 0.5 Acre Site within the New Development Boundary of Glandore Village"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "This is an attractive, easily developed Site located at the East end of Glandore Village.\r\n\r\nThis Plot of Land has recently been included under the extended adopted change of the Village Settlement (Ref: No VAR-05-2.41-01) of the Development Boundary for Glandore Village, under the Cork County Development Plan.\r\n\r\nThis Holding presents a great opportunity for those who wish to acquire a property with great future potential for a Residential Dwelling, within this attractive Village.\r\n\r\nGlandore, is renowned for its Marine Activities, Bars/Restaurants and local National School.\r\n\r\nServices adjacent\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      }
